<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/eli> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "[European Legislation Identifier (ELI)](https://eur-lex.europa.eu/content/help/eurlex-content/eli.html) is a Uniform Resource Identifier (URI) that uniquely identifies a legal resource, typically consisting of a document type, adoption year, and document number (e.g., `http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2024/2847/oj`)."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/AI/EnergyConsumptionDescription> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The class that helps note down the quantity of energy consumption and the unit\nused for measurement."@en .
